  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that models using scvi_n200 RNA encoder, imagenet_vit_l image encoder, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion (e.g., config_024) achieve the highest accuracy (0.725). This experiment tests whether substituting resnet50 for imagenet_vit_l (a smaller image encoder) with pca_n2000 RNA encoder maintains performance. It clarifies if the image encoder's complexity or RNA encoder type is more critical. This is the best use of the last experiment as it directly compares to the current top-performing configuration, with an estimated cost of 4.5 GPU hours."
}

